title: Cafetiere, one litre
coffee: 60 g, ground like coarse sea salt
water: 1000 g, just off the boil
time: 9:00

Add the coffee, then all the water, and start a timer.
At 4:00, stir the crust and scoop off the foam.
Wait five more minutes, then press gently, only as far as the coffee.
Pour it all out now, or it keeps brewing in the pot.
The <a href="{{link "prices"}}">Arch Blend</a> was made for this.
